    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109537" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόφῠσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>attachment underneath,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τένοντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					<u>UP</u>
					2.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>growth by way of substitution,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θατέρου [φλοιοῦ</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.15.1
			</span></i>; 
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθ᾽ ὑπόφυσιν αὔξονται [οἱ ὄνυχες],
					καθάπερ αἱ τρίχες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					2.337
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>sucker,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				EM
				784.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i></div>
